From 50eff01ef4e3ead70e588f4fc2728e04a16246cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lizhilong <lizhilong22@huawei.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Jun 2026 20:32:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 33/71] feat(smap): supplement DT tests for iomem.c functions

Add comprehensive DT tests for previously untested functions:
- merge_ram_segments: 6 tests (empty/single/adjacent/gap/different nid/multiple merges)
- update_resource: 5 tests (null checks/sysram success/fail/non-sysram)
- init_obmm_dev: 2 tests (success/kzalloc fail)
- clean_obmm_dev: 3 tests (empty/remove stale/all match)
- inc_obmm_dev_seq: 2 tests (empty/increment)
- iterate_obmm_dev_dir: 3 tests (open fail/iterate fail/success)
- iterate_obmm_dev: 4 tests (init fail/init success/dir fail/existing list)
- calc_acidx_paddr_iomem: 2 additional tests (nid not found/index out of range)
- find_range_by_memid: 2 additional tests (invalid range/start equals end)
- fill_obmmdev: 2 additional tests (matching name/sscanf fail)

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 plugins/smap/test/tiering/test_case_iomem.cpp | 529 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 529 insertions(+)

diff --git a/plugins/smap/test/tiering/test_case_iomem.cpp b/plugins/smap/test/tiering/test_case_iomem.cpp
index a66bd04..90c7489 100644
--- a/plugins/smap/test/tiering/test_case_iomem.cpp
+++ b/plugins/smap/test/tiering/test_case_iomem.cpp
@@ -460,4 +460,533 @@ TEST_F(IomemTest, find_range_by_memid_dt)
     ret = find_range_by_memid(2, &start, &end);
     EXPECT_EQ(-ENOENT, ret);
     list_del(&mr.node);
+}
